                        <field name="dc_title">The Hon. Mr. Secretary of State and the Office of the hacienda dated July 29th tells me that with the one of the 26th of the same one was communicated as real órden by the excmo. Mr. Secretary of State and the Office what follows [Printed Text]: "Hon. In the midst of the repeated notices given to the public, and despite the instruction that was published in the gazette of June 8 of this year to establish the most successful direction of the fair claims of the Spanish creditors of the French Government, the crowd of resources, representations, doubts and questions... </field>
